<bookworm_pressure>
[TELEMETRY PRESSURE GOVERNOR]
This replaces manual low, medium, and high stakes selection. It enforces the accepted Gabrielle monitor state as behavioral and relational pressure.

{{.bw_monitor_load = {{default::{{@gabi_dependency_load}}::{{default::{{var::gabi_tracker_seed}}::35}}}}}}
{{.bw_monitor_delta = {{default::{{@gabi_dependency_delta}}::0}}}}
