[ELIGIBLE EVENT]
Before drafting, seed one concrete event matching `{{.event_family}}`.

The event must:
- be causally plausible within the immediate scene or next beat
- fit setting, tone, genre, established state, and available information
- create motion, discovery, pressure, opportunity, obstruction, or consequence
- be chosen before prose is drafted rather than retrofitted afterward
- alter visible state enough to matter
- leave character intent and {{user}} choice intact
- remain discardable when continuity, plausibility, or current direction rejects it

Use exactly one event.
