phase={{default::{{@bookworm_phase}}::unresolved}} | salience={{default::{{@bookworm_salience}}::0}} | dependency={{default::{{@gabi_dependency_load}}::untracked}} | trend={{default::{{@gabi_dependency_trend}}::stable}}

Use these accepted values only as background pressure:
- higher salience makes the charged beat harder to dismiss
- rising dependency increases consequence and defensive urgency
- falling dependency may permit distance, regulation, or a less catastrophic read
- phase controls how much clarity has been narratively earned

Do not convert accumulated pressure into guaranteed certainty.
{{/if}}

